infinite-patch 1
# Tech House Percussive Chord Stab Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.25
  i steps 16
  i note0 55
  i note1 55
  i note2 62
  i note3 67
  i note4 55
  i note5 58
  i note6 62
  i note7 65
  i note8 55
  i note9 55
  i note10 62
  i note11 67
  i note12 58
  i note13 60
  i note14 62
